---
---
<section id="what-is-it" class="section what-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="attio-badge crimson">
        <svg style="width:12px; height:12px;" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4"/><path d="M12 8h.01"/></svg>
        <span>What is LamaniSync?</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        <span class="heading-dark">The missing link for clinical automation.</span>
        <span class="heading-muted">Connecting your clinic software directly to LamaniHub WhatsApp booking.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        Clinics lose thousands of dollars each month from missed calls and delayed replies. LamaniHub solves this by answering patient inquiries and booking appointments 24/7 on WhatsApp. LamaniSync connects the chat directly to your doctor's chair.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- The Comparison / Layman Breakdown -->
    <div class="problem-solution-card">
      <div class="col-box problem-box">
        <div class="box-badge problem">The Old Problem</div>
        <h3 class="box-title">Traditional Clinic Systems Are Locked Down</h3>
        <p class="box-text">
          Most Clinic Management Systems (CMS / EHR) do not provide open webhooks or public cloud APIs. To automate bookings, clinics traditionally had to hire expensive IT consultants, set up dangerous firewall port forwarding, or force front-desk staff to manually re-type WhatsApp chats into their software.
        </p>
        <ul class="box-list problem-list">
          <li>
            <svg style="width:16px; height:16px;" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg>
            <span>Staff manually copy-pasting patient details from WhatsApp</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg style="width:16px; height:16px;" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg>
            <span>Risk of double booking when doctors update calendars internally</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg style="width:16px; height:16px;" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg>
            <span>Expensive custom API integration projects costing thousands</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="solution-divider">
        <div class="vs-badge">VS</div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-box solution-box">
        <div class="box-badge solution">The LamaniSync Solution</div>
        <h3 class="box-title">A Secure Front-Desk Workstation Bridge</h3>
        <p class="box-text">
          LamaniSync runs as a lightweight, secure Chrome Extension on the same computer where your reception team already opens the clinic software. It securely reads real-time schedule openings and writes bookings directly into your calendar with zero manual work.
        </p>
        <ul class="box-list solution-list">
          <li>
            <svg style="width:16px; height:16px;" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span><strong>Instant Automated Entry:</strong> WhatsApp bookings appear directly on your calendar</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg style="width:16px; height:16px;" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span><strong>Zero Open Ports:</strong> Operates entirely inside outbound HTTPS/WSS tunnels</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg style="width:16px; height:16px;" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span><strong>Readback Verification:</strong> Guarantees appointments are written before confirming</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Value Pillars -->
    <div class="pillars-grid">
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <div class="pillar-icon">
          <svg style="width:22px; height:22px;" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="pillar-title">Dedicated to LamaniHub</h4>
        <p class="pillar-desc">
          Not a generic, one-size-fits-all tool. LamaniSync is engineered specifically to coordinate with LamaniHub's CRM pipelines and WhatsApp booking conversational workflows.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pillar-card">
        <div class="pillar-icon">
          <svg style="width:22px; height:22px;" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="23 4 23 10 17 10"/><polyline points="1 20 1 14 7 14"/><path d="M3.51 9a9 9 0 0 1 14.85-3.36L23 10M1 14l4.64 4.36A9 9 0 0 0 20.49 15"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="pillar-title">Real-Time Two-Way Sync</h4>
        <p class="pillar-desc">
          Synchronizes doctor shifts, blocked lunch breaks, and available slots continuously so LamaniHub never offers a time slot that is already booked or unavailable.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pillar-card">
        <div class="pillar-icon">
          <svg style="width:22px; height:22px;" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="3" rx="2"/><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="21" y2="21"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="17" y2="21"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="pillar-title">Zero Local Server Installation</h4>
        <p class="pillar-desc">
          No Python scripts, no Windows background services, and no terminal commands. Simply install from the Chrome Web Store, pair in 30 seconds, and let it run quietly.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .what-section {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background: #ffffff;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
  }

  .section-head {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 840px;
    margin: 0 auto 3.5rem auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.22;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }

  .section-desc {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .problem-solution-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.03);
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .col-box {
    padding: 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .problem-box {
    background: #fafafa;
  }

  .solution-box {
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .box-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    align-self: flex-start;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
  }

  .box-badge.problem {
    background: #f1f5f9;
    color: #64748b;
    border-color: var(--border-hairline);
  }

  .box-badge.solution {
    background: #fff1f3;
    color: var(--primary);
    border-color: #fecdd6;
  }

  .box-title {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  .box-text {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
  }

  .box-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .box-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .problem-list li svg {
    color: #94a3b8;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  .solution-list li svg {
    color: var(--primary);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  .solution-divider {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: #fafafa;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    padding: 0 1rem;
  }

  .vs-badge {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #64748b;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
  }

  .pillars-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }

  .pillar-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: 2rem;
    transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.02);
  }

  .pillar-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: #cbd5e1;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
  }

  .pillar-icon {
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    color: var(--text-main);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .pillar-card:hover .pillar-icon {
    color: var(--primary);
    border-color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .pillar-title {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin-bottom: 0.55rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .pillar-desc {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .problem-solution-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .solution-divider {
      border-left: none;
      border-right: none;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
      padding: 0.75rem 0;
    }
    .pillars-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .what-section {
      padding: 4rem 0;
    }
    .col-box {
      padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
    }
    .pillar-card {
      padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
